GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Uga-Buga Makumb (#1):
  In spring, Rejaf was hit by a plague.
  Giovanna (#7) ordered an invasion force into the adjacent Desert province 
of Rejaf, owned by Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1).  Giovanna (#7) 
commanded the invading armies.  The defenders were led by Guerin (#18).  
Giovanna (#7)'s host ended the campaign successfully and conquered the 
province of Rejaf.
  In early winter, Guerin (#18) flew over to Rejaf.
  In late summer, Odysseus (#97) flew over to Rejaf.
  Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) ordered an invasion force into the 
Desert province of Rejaf, owned by Giovanna (#7).  Rejaf was overrun and 
occupied by Odysseus (#97)'s host.
  In spring, the Desert terrain of Rejaf was magically made to appear as 
Mountain.
  In late summer, the Plain terrain of Kajaani was magically made to appear 
as Mountain.


Kingdom of Giovanna (#7):
  In spring, Giovanna (#7) ordered an invasion force into the adjacent 
Desert province of Rejaf, owned by Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1).  
Giovanna (#7) commanded the invading armies.  The defenders were led by 
Guerin (#18).  Giovanna (#7)'s host ended the campaign successfully and 
conquered the province of Rejaf.
  In late summer, the Plain terrain of Kajaani was magically made to appear 
as Mountain.
  Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) ordered an invasion force into the 
Desert province of Rejaf, owned by Giovanna (#7).  Rejaf was overrun and 
occupied by Odysseus (#97)'s host.
  In late summer, Kajaani was magically flooded.


